BT /F2 8 Tf 0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 1.8 Tc 64.00 776.00 Td (SECTION 5) Tj ET
BT /F2 21 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 64.00 746.00 Td (Publishing Safety) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 64.00 730.00 34.00 2.50 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 64.00 706.00 Td (Scheduling is backed by PostgreSQL. The publishing worker claims due posts with row-level locks so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 64.00 691.00 Td (that a post is processed by exactly one worker, exactly once.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 669.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 667.00 Td (Due posts are claimed with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED. The row lock makes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 652.50 Td (duplicate publishing impossible, even if several workers run at the same time.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 636.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 634.00 Td (The claim query refuses posts that belong to suspended or deleted accounts. This hold is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 619.50 Td (enforced at the database level, so a suspension and a worker claim cannot race each other.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 603.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 601.00 Td (Held posts stay held until an administrator resumes them. Resuming an overdue held post is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 586.50 Td (blocked; the post must be rescheduled instead of being published immediately, which prevents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 572.00 Td (surprise duplicate or late publishing.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 555.70 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 553.50 Td (Every create, hold, resume, retry, publish, and failure is recorded in the activity infrastructure with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 539.00 Td (a scheduled_post action.) Tj ET
0.937 0.965 1 rg 64.00 479.00 467.28 44.50 re f
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 64.00 479.00 3.00 44.50 re f
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 78.00 514.50 Td (Enforced by the application) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 78.00 501.50 Td (Row-level claim locking, account-state enforcement, hold behavior, and audit logging of publishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 78.00 488.00 Td (actions are part of the scheduler's core transaction logic.) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 0.420 0.447 0.502 rg 0 Tc 64.00 466.00 Td (Administrators can review every scheduled post, including held and failed ones, from the Scheduler page.) Tj ET
