BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 706.00 Td (Sensitive values such as social tokens, OAuth secrets, and passwords are never displayed in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 691.50 Td (dashboard and are never returned by an admin API.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 675.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 673.00 Td (Social account tokens remain encrypted at rest with AES-256-GCM.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 656.70 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 654.50 Td (Activity metadata is sanitized before it is stored. Passwords, tokens, secrets, and encryption keys) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 640.00 Td (never enter activity records.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 623.70 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 621.50 Td (Every admin API request verifies the Super Admin session server-side before it processes data.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 605.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 603.00 Td (Database access runs server-side through an authorized service connection. An optional) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 588.50 Td (hardening migration additionally enables row-level security on the scheduling and authentication) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 574.00 Td (tables and revokes direct browser-facing access to them.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 557.70 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 555.50 Td (Deleting a user is a soft delete that preserves audit history, and account relationships are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 541.00 Td (protected by database foreign keys.) Tj ET
