0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 64.00 730.00 34.00 2.50 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 64.00 706.00 Td (Most protections described in this guide run automatically. A smaller set of good practices depends) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 64.00 691.00 Td (on you as the administrator. These are recommendations, not enforced features.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 64.00 654.00 Td (Recommended practices) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 635.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 633.00 Td (Use a strong, unique administrator password that meets the console minimum of 12 characters) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 618.50 Td (with three of four character types, and do not reuse it on other services.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 602.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 600.00 Td (Never share administrator credentials or one-time codes with anyone. No legitimate support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 585.50 Td (process will ask for them.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 569.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 567.00 Td (Sign out other sessions from Settings when a device is lost, replaced, or no longer used.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 550.70 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 548.50 Td (Review social account connection statuses periodically and reconnect any expired or invalid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 534.00 Td (connection before its next scheduled post.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 517.70 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 515.50 Td (Review scheduled posts before their publish window and hold anything that is not ready to go out.) Tj ET
0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 65.50 499.20 3.00 3.00 re f
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 497.00 Td (Keep the authentication and email delivery configuration valid and up to date so one-time codes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.067 0.094 0.153 rg 0 Tc 80.00 482.50 Td (and security messages actually arrive.) Tj ET
